body:
you can paste this into the curvy pipes config after renaming and removing "default" from the title:
  item_base:
    result: { count: 1, item: curvy_pipes:small_item_pipe }
    type: crafting_shaped
    key: { A: { tag: forge:plates/steel }, B: { tag: forge:plates/steel } }
    pattern: [ ' A ', 'B B', ' A ' ]
  fluid_base:
    result: { count: 1, item: curvy_pipes:small_fluid_pipe }
    type: crafting_shaped
    key: { A: { tag: forge:plates/stainless_steel }, B: { tag: forge:plates/stainless_steel } }
    pattern: [ ' A ', 'B B', ' A ' ]
  energy_base:
    result: { count: 3, item: curvy_pipes:small_energy_pipe }
    type: crafting_shaped
    key: { A: { tag: forge:plates/plastic }, B: { tag: forge:ingots/constantan } }
    pattern: [ ' A ', 'ABA', ' A ' ]

this will change the recipes for the pipes to fit the textures
